      - title: en
        value: "2. Tr\xE1nh s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\xE1c k\xFD hi\u1EC7u \u0111\u1EB7c
          bi\u1EC7t ho\u1EB7c c\xE1c k\xFD t\u1EF1 ng\xF4n ng\u1EEF kh\xE1c: T\xEAn
          chi nh\xE1nh n\xEAn tr\xE1nh c\xE1c k\xFD t\u1EF1 n\xE0y. \u0110i\u1EC1u
          n\xE0y \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o r\u1EB1ng d\u1EF1 \xE1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
          ph\xE1t tri\u1EC3n tr\xEAn c\xE1c thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB c\xF3 ng\xF4n ng\u1EEF
          kh\xE1c nhau. V\xE0 gi\xFAp nh\xF3m hi\u1EC3u r\xF5 m\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch
          c\u1EE7a chi nh\xE1nh h\u01A1n."
