      - title: en
        value: "C\xE1c b\u01B0\u1EDBc quy tr\xECnh hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i m\xE0 ch\xFAng
          t\xF4i \u0111ang th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n: 1. \u0110\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o phi\xEAn
          b\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a 'development branch' v\xE0 'ch\xEDnh gi\u1ED1ng v\u1EDBi
          \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n t\u1EEB xa. 2. H\u1EE3p nh\u1EA5t 'main branch'
