          Ki\u1EC3m tra m\u1ECDi s\u1EF1 c\u1ED1 trong d\u1EF1 \xE1n sau khi h\u1EE3p
          nh\u1EA5t.</color> 4. T\u1EA3i 'development branch' \u0111\xE3 h\u1EE3p
          nh\u1EA5t l\xEAn \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n t\u1EEB xa."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u76EE\u524D\u5DF2\u9032\u884C\u7684\u6D41\u7A0B\uFF1A\n1. \u78BA\u8A8D
