      - title: en
        value: "Vui l\xF2ng \u0111i t\u1EDBi 'tr\u01B0\u1EDDng l\u1EC7nh \u0111\u1EA7u
          v\xE0o' c\u1EE7a c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 'D\xF2ng l\u1EC7nh'\r v\xE0 g\xF5 \r\n'<color=#CF001C>git
          --version</color>' ho\u1EB7c '<color=#CF001C>git -v</color>'.\r\nL\u01B0u
          \xFD r\u1EB1ng ki\u1EC3u ch\u1EEF c\xE1i ph\u1EA3i kh\u1EDBp ch\xEDnh x\xE1c,\r\nand
          'git' ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE2n t\xE1ch kh\u1ECFi '--version'
          b\u1EB1ng d\u1EA5u c\xE1ch."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u8ACB\u5728 '\u547D\u4EE4\u5217' \u8996\u7A97\u7684 '\u8F38\u5165\u6307\u4EE4'
          \u5340\u57DF\n\u8F38\u5165 '<color=#CF001C>git --version</color>' \u6216'<color=#CF001C>git
          -v</color>'\n\u6CE8\u610F\u5927\u5C0F\u5BEB\u9700\u8981\u4E00\u81F4\n'git'
          \u548C '--version' \u4E4B\u9593\u7528\u7A7A\u683C\u5206\u96E2"
