      - title: en
        value: "N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn v\u1EC1 c\xE1ch x\xF3a
          t\u1EC7p kh\u1ECFi tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i 'Staged', \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t
