          b\u1EA1n c\u1EA7n s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng l\u1EC7nh '<color=#CF001C>git status</color>'.
          L\u1EC7nh n\xE0y cho ph\xE9p b\u1EA1n xem nh\u1EEFng g\xEC hi\u1EC7n c\xF3
          b\xEAn trong Staging Area."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u82E5\u8981\u78BA\u8A8D '\u66AB\u5B58\u5340\u57DF' \u7684\u5167\u5BB9\n\u60A8\u9700\u8981\u4F7F\u7528
