      - title: en
        value: "1. Vui l\xF2ng t\xECm thanh c\xF4ng c\u1EE5 trong tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i.
          \nN\xF3 n\u1EB1m \u1EDF d\u01B0\u1EDBi c\xF9ng c\u1EE7a m\xE0n h\xECnh."
