      - title: en
        value: "2. T\xECm n\xFAt m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 'File Manager'. B\u1EA1n
          c\xF3 th\u1EC3 di chu\u1ED9t qua c\xE1c n\xFAt \u0111\u1EC3 xem ch\xFAng
