      - title: en
        value: "3. Trong s\u1ED1 c\xE1c l\u1EC7nh Git, c\xF3 m\u1ED9t l\u1EC7nh c\u1EE5
          th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EA9y c\xE1c t\u1EC7p t\u1EEB v\xF9ng t\u1ED5
          ch\u1EE9c v\xE0o kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF. Ngo\xE0i ra, tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i c\xF2n
          cung c\u1EA5p t\xEDnh n\u0103ng auto-fill cho th\xF4ng b\xE1o commit.
          Vui l\xF2ng tra c\u1EE9u n\xF3 trong H\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i
          \u0111\u1EC3 bi\u1EBFt chi ti\u1EBFt."
