      - title: en
        value: "2. Chi\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3c chi nh\xE1nh: \r\nT\xEDnh n\u0103ng
          qu\u1EA3n l\xFD chi nh\xE1nh c\u1EE7a Git gi\xFAp qu\xE1 tr\xECnh ph\xE1t
          tri\u1EC3n d\u1EF1 \xE1n di\u1EC5n ra su\xF4n s\u1EBB. \r\nB\u1EA1n c\xF3
