      - title: en
        value: "M\xF4 t\u1EA3 n\xE0o sau \u0111\xE2y <color=#CF001C>not</color> l\xE0
          m\u1ED9t t\xEDnh n\u0103ng c\u1EE7a ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n?
          A. D\u1EC5 d\xE0ng theo d\xF5i nh\u1EEFng thay \u0111\u1ED5i gi\u1EEFa
          c\xE1c t\u1EADp tin. B. Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u sao ch\xE9p file tr\xEAn d\u1EF1
          \xE1n \u0111\u1EC3 qu\u1EA3n l\xFD. C. Th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
          s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng trong c\xE1c d\u1EF1 \xE1n l\u1EDBn. D. Thu\u1EADn ti\u1EC7n
          cho vi\u1EC7c so s\xE1nh s\u1EF1 kh\xE1c bi\u1EC7t gi\u1EEFa c\xE1c phi\xEAn
          b\u1EA3n."
