      - title: en
        value: "1. Trong s\u1ED1 c\xE1c l\u1EC7nh Git c\xF3 c\xE1c l\u1EC7nh c\u1EE5
          th\u1EC3 \n\u0111\u1EC3 th\xEAm t\u1EC7p v\xE0o ho\u1EB7c x\xF3a ch\xFAng
