      - title: en
        value: "\u0110\u1EC3 x\xF3a m\u1ED9t nh\xE1nh b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 t\u1EA1o,
          tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\xEAn b\u1EA1n ph\u1EA3i chuy\u1EC3n sang m\u1ED9t nh\xE1nh
          kh\xE1c. Vi\u1EC7c th\u1EF1c thi l\u1EC7nh '<color=#CF001C>git checkout
          master</color>' s\u1EBD cho ph\xE9p b\u1EA1n chuy\u1EC3n phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n
          d\u1EF1 \xE1n hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i nh\xE1nh 'master'."
