      - title: en
        value: "Ch\xFAng ta c\u1EA7n m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 'File Manager'. \u0110i\u1EC1u
          n\xE0y s\u1EBD cho ph\xE9p ch\xFAng t\xF4i xem t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c
