      - title: en
        value: "2. Trong s\u1ED1 c\xE1c l\u1EC7nh Git, \nc\xF3 m\u1ED9t l\u1EC7nh
          c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1EE3p nh\u1EA5t m\u1ED9t nh\xE1nh.\nB\u1EA1n
          c\u1EA7n th\xEAm t\xEAn nh\xE1nh sau l\u1EC7nh.\nVui l\xF2ng tra c\u1EE9u
          n\xF3 trong H\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i \u0111\u1EC3 bi\u1EBFt
          chi ti\u1EBFt."
